WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.8 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Evaluation

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Evaluation asks whether, why and for whom your work makes a difference.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Pick the three to five questions that matter.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Match the type and cost to your purpose.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan how you will act on findings.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Does girls' growing confidence lead to choosing science subjects? Which girls benefit least, and why?”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your evaluation questions, approach and plan for use.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
